zc0|n|One of several species of wild goats having very large, recurved horns, transversely ridged in front; -- called also steinbok.	a:zbz,173,5;12uu,171,21~12uu,171,21;zbz,173,5	n:fti,84,10~fti,84,10	N:1gzx,85,2~1gzx,85,2
zc4|n|Any bird of the genus Ibis and several allied genera, of the family Ibidae, inhabiting both the Old World and the New. Numerous species are known. They are large, wading birds, having a long, curved beak, and feed largely on reptiles.	N:1fsp,95,2~1fsp,95,2
